@title Crane template options: two hoist units, frequency drives, circuits on the pages
@area Schematic
wait 20
click_text File
wait 6
move 260 466
wait 8
click 600 466
wait 12
click_text "2"
click_text "Frequency drive" #1
wait 6
shot options-two-units-frequency
click_text "Create project"
wait 30
shot page-1-supply
key PageDown
key PageDown
key PageDown
wait 12
shot page-4-crab-travel
key PageDown
wait 12
shot page-5-hoist-unit-1
check_layout
key PageDown
wait 12
shot page-6-hoist-unit-2
check_layout
